WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.940
Hello everybody! My name is Markiplier

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:03.300
and welcome to The Onioning

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.280
now it's been a while since I played a memey, stupid, horror game

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:09.200
and good to know that this is absolutely not that

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.060
In fact this might be

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:13.060
the scariest horror game..

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:14.140
of 2016.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.740
In the little bit of time we have in 2016,

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:19.740
I think we may be facing the most dire threat we've... [scream in the distance]

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.740
[screaming continues]

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:25.300
...the most dire threat we've ever faced

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.220
in our entire life.

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:29.720
Good to know that mirror is functioning perfectly

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:31.840
as a window into the underworld

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:35.260
and I'm approaching this wall with utter care.

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:38.480
OK, here we go! Oooh boy (chuckle)

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:41.480
Oh! What a lovely bed I've got! *laughing*

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:44.040
Ooh! What a lovely pillow!

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:47.260
Aah! Just shaped like a dead g- ohh that doesn't work at all.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:48.140
Hello!

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:49.040
Ok. Goodbye.

00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:53.100
I thought I put... I thought I put the graphics on this to be "ogrewhelming!"

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:54.660
Oh boy...

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:56.680
Literally, that was a graphics option

00:00:57.060 --> 00:00:59.500
It was: Low, Medium, High and then

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:01.260
(Deep voice) Ogrewhelming...

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:04.140
Hello! Ooh-oh-nohohoho

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:06.500
Every object in here, I can- I can tell was

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:08.020
custom made in Blender

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:10.020
just for this occasion. Even the-

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:12.200
Even the- even the illustrious mirrors here.

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:14.460
OK. Well... [light bulb explodes] *gasps at the jumpscare*

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:16.840
The fuck..?

00:01:18.940 --> 00:01:24.400
*Deep Voice Singing*

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:25.220
Oh-oh-oh-n...

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:28.120
*Continued Singing*

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:30.720
Oh-oh-oh-no-ho-ho
(nervous laughing)

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.180
Oh boy. Can I- Oh boy...

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:37.040
Where am I? Oh that's not good
[Continued Singing]

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:41.180
He-he. Hi shrek!

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:42.460
How's it going?

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:45.720
You good? I'm good! If you're good I'm good. Ok...

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:47.840
[light bulb explodes] [Singing Stops] Hoookay...

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:49.620
*reads sign*
I'm coming Ogre!

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:51.620
Oh good! I love company!

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:53.940
Oohhhh! I'll be so not alone anymore!

00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:57.320
Oh what is that? ... wee-wee-weeeeb?

00:01:57.500 --> 00:01:59.700
I can't even run so- ooooh... Hello

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:01.920
Alright. I can't get near this door.

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:03.160
[doorbell ring]

00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:05.720
OH! COMPANY!

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:06.900
OH BOY!

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:09.680
I still can't get near the god damn door!

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:11.980
Do I even wanna answer that door?

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:14.680
Is- Is he coming ogre?

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:16.440
I can't go near the god damn doo-

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:17.660
OH! Here we go!

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:20.340
HI! OH GOD!! Blood!

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:22.540
OH GOD! Flashing hallway light!

00:02:22.540 --> 00:02:24.800
OH GOD! Dark abyss!

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:27.480
OH GOD!  I'm gonna die!

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:29.300
Alright here we go then...

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:30.720
I'm trusting this...

00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:33.380
*HEADPHONE WARNING* I don't know WHY I'm trusting this. Oh boy...

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:34.680
[Shrek: HELLO THERE]

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:36.520
Fucking fuck!

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:40.100
[hurtful sharp squealing]
OWW?!

00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:41.780
OOOOH!!!!

00:02:41.780 --> 00:02:44.320
[Strangely ominous music that is played in Hell in the background]

00:02:44.320 --> 00:02:47.280
OH! Oh! I've been transferred!

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:50.380
Oh boy. Ah geez.

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:52.880
Oh no... Oh God. no...

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:56.020
Oh no-ho-ho-ho-ho-ho

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:58.660
I don't remember this in any of the Shrek movies...

00:02:58.660 --> 00:02:59.580
Oh boy...

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:03.060
In fact I don't remember any of this in anything I've ever done in my li-

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:05.500
li-i-ife... H-hi Shrek...
[Musics stops]

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:09.000
Oh! You're whispering such sweet nothings into my ear...

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:12.200
Oooohh. It's so-ho-ho-ho illuminating.

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:14.340
Oh no...What is that?!

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:16.600
Hello! Hi friend? Oh!

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:18.000
Oh.

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:20.080
Is there someone behind me?

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:23.780
Ok. I thought that was for s- OOH!!

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:26.860
HEY! Ohh my god! That's astonishingly creepy!

00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:29.100
[Demonic grunting]

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:32.120
OKAY?!

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:34.060
ALRIGHTY THEN! GOOD TO MEET YOU, SHREK!

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:36.020
[Loud Deep Scream] OOH FUCKING, FUCK YOUUU!

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:39.560
Fuck you man!

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:42.460
Oh boy! Am-Am I back in my bed?

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:44.100
Oh I bet I'm not!

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:46.380
Oh god! What is this? *chuckle*

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:48.840
Oh! Is this supposed to be me tied to a table?

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:51.340
Oh no, no it's not!

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:53.460
Oh ok! Alright then.

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:55.220
Wow! That lens flare though!

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:56.600
Oh boy...

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:58.960
So-So what do- What am I supposed to interpret from this?!

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:01.960
So are these knife gashes in the table here and is that my blood?

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:03.980
What's with the TV?

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:07.860
Just something to watch while I'm bored, while I'm being eviscerated. You know.

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:09.200
Just something relaxing

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:12.200
Welp... I bet I can't open any of these.

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:14.380
Alright. Well! That one's got blood in it! Huh!

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:15.900
Ah!
[Screams from the other side of the door]

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:17.900
I'm sorry. They're--

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:20.160
They're having a good time in here.

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:22.160
[Screaming continues]

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:23.780
[Weird Noises From Distance]

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:26.500
Ok! Alright! You know what, maybe I don't need to bother them!

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:30.740
Maybe they're just having a peaceful time by themselves and they don't wanna be bothered.

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:31.780
Okay...

00:04:31.780 --> 00:04:33.500
Well I guess that's all there is so...

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:35.500
Lets uh, meander over here...

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:36.120
Hello?

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:36.780
*Weird accent* Shrekles?

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.100
Body dump?

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:40.260
How convenient! Body dump!

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:41.260
Oh boy...

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:42.760
[Shrek: HELLO THERE!]

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:46.400
UH, BODY DUMP?!
[Loud Bang On Door]

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:47.400
BODY DUMP!?! [Shrek Trying To Break Door]

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:49.580
OKAY I GO DOWN THE BODY DUMP! [Shrek Continuing To Break Door]

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.600
WEEHOOO!

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:53.860
WEEEEEEEEEEEEHHHHHHH!!!!

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:56.880
I go. I- Have fun! I guess...

00:04:57.940 --> 00:05:01.620
Oh boy... [Water Splash] more. Wow! This game is so evolved!

00:05:01.620 --> 00:05:03.300
Game of the year! 10 out of 10!

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:04.240
11 out of 10!

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.440
22 out of 10!

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:06.760
Oh boy.

00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:08.360
Oh boy...

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:10.540
What's with the red ominous glo-o-ow?

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:15.160
Well ok. I f- Oh f- I don't feel good about pressing random buttons.

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:16.260
Oh it's an elevator...

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:16.960
Oh. Ok.

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:17.940
Gwe...

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:20.800
Dre-Dreamworks Research?!?

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:24.700
Oh! You know research to find out what the kids like in the next Shrek movie.

00:05:24.940 --> 00:05:25.900
Oh boy.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:27.140
Ooh boy!

00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:29.320
Inside everyth - I can't read that...

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:33.060
If someone wanted to zoom in and read that, then maybe they'd have a better time about that, but I have better-

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:34.200
Oohkaay...

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:37.960
I don't like this, not one bit. The Boss said everything is fine but Dave and I can see through his bullshit.

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:40.520
Whatever we're creating , it's not safe at all. *Mark giggles*

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:45.020
It's too dangerous to go through with it, considering we're in a fucking sewer to do this research with no security.

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:46.800
Just this whole thing is super shady.

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:47.580
Dave agrees with me.

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:49.960
Whatever DreamWorks wants us to create, I don't want anything to do with it.

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:52.780
I don't care if I lose my job, I just want out of this crazy shit.

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:55.120
Dave and I are gonna tell the boss we're quitting tomorrow.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:56.360
Let's hope everything goes well.

00:05:56.360 --> 00:06:00.960
Oh! I imagine that not everything goes well if there's blood dripping from your oozing vent.

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:02.000
Oh boy.

00:06:02.180 --> 00:06:02.880
Oh boy!

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:04.200
Fell?

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:05.320
Fell?!

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:07.660
FELL?! What kind of keypad is that?

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:09.440
I didn't even need to put in anything!

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:10.400
Oh, ok!

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:12.340
Long hallway of blood!

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:13.120
ooohh...

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:15.380
Oh n-oh my god

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:16.520
Automated voice: Hold it right there!

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:19.220
Automated voice: Who are you and how did you get here?

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:21.540
Uh..

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:22.380
How did I get here?

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:23.740
Automated voice: Not gonna talk, eh?

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:26.100
Automated voice: Alright. I see how it is.

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:29.020
Automated voice: Maybe you'll talk after this.

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:31.260
[Spray sound]
Oooh... After what?!

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:31.780
[Thud]

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:33.880
Oo-AAW MY BRAIN!

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:35.280
What the heck happened!?

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:38.060
I have no idea of what's going on...
Oh! No!

00:06:38.060 --> 00:06:40.060
Am I tie- 
Automated voice: Oh. You've finally awoken. (Markiplier laughs)

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:44.200
Automated voice: Good. Now. Let's try that again.

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:46.280
Automated voice: Why were you in that god forsaken sewer?

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:49.100
I don't know man... I don't know.

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:51.960
I'm just trying to sleep, you know!

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:53.460
Like most horror games.

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:55.600
I was just trying to live!

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:57.420
Automated voice: You still aren't going to answer me?

00:06:57.420 --> 00:06:58.220
Uuh
Automated voice: Why?

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:02.000
Automated voice: Is it because you're scared or do you just don't know how to?

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:04.000
I don-
Automated voice: Either way, you've seen too much.

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:06.480
Ohh.
Automated voice: You know about him.

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:07.620
Oh no.

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:09.560
Unknown: Don't you?
Noo!

00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:12.780
(gives info anyways)
Automated voice: His name is Shrek. And he's something that can be never known to the public

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:14.900
Oh ok.
Automated voice: We created him for DreamWorks.

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:15.620
Automated voice: Why?

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:17.720
Automated voice: Well, I don't even know that.

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:20.040
Automated voice: Even though I was, quote on quote "Boss".

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:24.400
Automated voice: I was still just a puppet. Taking orders from the higher ups.

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:27.060
Automated voice: And the orders were to make that damn ogre.

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:30.740
Automated voice: It was stupid I know. Then I wound up having to kill poor old Dave and Martin.

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:33.940
Automated voice: DreamWorks told me, if they ever told me they were going to quit.

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:35.160
Automated voice: I would have to kill them.

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:38.720
Automated voice: They told me they couldn't risk Dave and Martin, breaking their MDA.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:42.100
Automated voice: Because if they did, DreamWorks would be one hundred percent fucked.

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:45.720
Automated voice: And if I were to quit, or not do as I was told, they would kill me.

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:47.060
Automated voice: Either way I was fucked.

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:48.500
Automated voice: I had no choice.

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:51.500
Automated voice: I remember the faithfull day, that damn ogre broke out.

00:07:51.840 --> 00:07:54.260
Automated voice: I was with a bunch of the higher ups from DreamWorks.

00:07:54.260 --> 00:07:57.640
Automated voice: Showing them the progress that the three of us had made, before I had to kill them.

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.320
Automated voice: Then, well, something happened.

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:00.080
Automated voice: He...

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:02.780
Automated voice: Awakened.

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:04.440
Automated voice: Started ripping the guys in half.

00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:06.520
Automated voice: Blood everywhere. They tried the door.

00:08:06.520 --> 00:08:08.920
Automated voice: Sealed shut, they tried to go through the air ducks.

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:11.380
Automated voice: Shrek just came after them and tore them to pieces.

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:15.580
Automated voice: I managed to escape. Through a secret passage, that was built into the walls.

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:17.260
Automated voice: I was the sole survivor.

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:20.140
Automated voice: And now I'm here. Watching, Observing the ogre.

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:21.420
Automated voice: Wait. What the.

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:23.000
Automated voice: Oh shit.

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:27.400
[Shrek screaming]

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:31.140
*click* Oh! Hey! Hi! Shrek! How are you doing? *click*

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:32.520
Oh, okay.

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:37.380
[Distorted All Star song playing] *Mark laughing* Oh no!

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:39.580
Oh oh oh oh. Oh my God...

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:42.580
Oh, okay! I guess that's the end!

00:08:42.900 --> 00:08:44.260
Ooh, alright!

00:08:44.260 --> 00:08:46.880
*giggling* "A short game that took way too long to make"

00:08:47.260 --> 00:08:49.060
But it was lovely nonetheless!

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:50.200
Game of the year!

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:52.660
And just in at the last two! You know!

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:54.900
Oh man! That was-

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:56.600
I lov-*sniff* For some reason,

00:08:56.600 --> 00:09:00.140
I don't know why, but these Shrek meme horror games-

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:03.620
are better then a lot of any indie horror games that I played.

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:05.960
It was just- oh man- that was so silly.

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:09.120
But either way, thank you everybody so much for watching! Hope you enjoyed that.

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:12.100
I got more horror games in my list, I just wanted to get through this one, because...

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:16.660
I don't, I have a special soft spot in my heart for these Shrek horror games.

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:18.420
And I haven't played a lot of them!

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:20.840
Just- I think the other one was, "Get out of my swamp"-

00:09:20.840 --> 00:09:22.840
I'll put a link to that one in the description, but-

00:09:22.940 --> 00:09:27.640
Thank you everybody so much for watching, and as always, I will see YOU in the next vi-

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:29.100
[Shrek; Oh ho yea!]
(an interrupting loud noise)

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:31.920
Wha- fuck you buddy!

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.040
...in the next video

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:34.880
BUH-BYE!!

